IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg7-governing-provisions`
IMPORT `dg7-appraisal-rights`

-- Tests of dg7-appraisal-rights.l4 (8 Del. C. s 262(a), (b), (c)).
-- Every expected value is decided here from the text of s 262 (src:1252-1262), then compared with the rule's answer.
-- Fixtures are built by small functions because L4 has no record-update operator.

§ `Fixtures`

GIVEN stock IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 262(a) Instrument`
`test an instrument with` stock MEANS
    `s 262(a) Instrument` WITH
        `it is a receipt or other instrument issued by a depository` IS TRUE
        `it represents an interest in 1 or more shares, or fractions thereof` IS TRUE
        `the shares or fractions are solely of stock of a corporation` IS stock
        `that stock is deposited with the depository` IS TRUE

GIVEN formed IS A `Where an entity is formed`
      record IS A BOOLEAN
      onDemand IS A BOOLEAN
      continuous IS A BOOLEAN
      complied IS A BOOLEAN
      voted IS A BOOLEAN
      consented IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 262(a) Claimant`
`test a claimant with` formed record onDemand continuous complied voted consented MEANS
    `s 262(a) Claimant` WITH
        `the stock is stock of a corporation formed` IS formed
        `the claimant holds the stock as holder of record` IS record
        `held shares of stock on the date of the making of the demand` IS onDemand
        `continuously held the shares through the effective date` IS continuous
        `has otherwise complied with subsection (d)` IS complied
        `voted in favor of the merger, consolidation, conversion, transfer, domestication or continuance` IS voted
        `consented to it in writing pursuant to s 228` IS consented

`test the claimant who did everything right` MEANS
    `test a claimant with` `this State` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE

GIVEN kind IS A `s 262(b)(2) What the holders are required to accept`
      issuerIsCorporation IS A BOOLEAN
      listed IS A BOOLEAN
      holders IS A NUMBER
      fractional IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 262(b)(2) Item of consideration`
`test an item of consideration` kind issuerIsCorporation listed holders fractional MEANS
    `s 262(b)(2) Item of consideration` WITH
        `what the holders are required to accept` IS kind
        `the issuer is a corporation` IS issuerIsCorporation
        `the shares or depository receipts were listed on a national securities exchange at the effective date` IS listed
        `the number of holders of record at the effective date` IS holders
        `the fractional shares or depository receipts are of a kind described in a. or b.` IS fractional

-- a.: stock of the surviving or resulting corporation (an issuer that is a corporation).
`test survivor stock` MEANS
    `test an item of consideration` `shares of stock of the surviving or resulting corporation, or of the converted entity or the entity resulting from a transfer, domestication or continuance, or depository receipts in respect thereof` TRUE FALSE 0 FALSE
-- a.: stock of an entity that is not a corporation (a converted limited liability company): not within a.
`test stock of a converted entity that is not a corporation` MEANS
    `test an item of consideration` `shares of stock of the surviving or resulting corporation, or of the converted entity or the entity resulting from a transfer, domestication or continuance, or depository receipts in respect thereof` FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE
-- b.: stock of another corporation, listed.
`test listed stock of another corporation` MEANS
    `test an item of consideration` `shares of stock of any other corporation, or depository receipts in respect thereof` TRUE TRUE 10 FALSE
-- b.: stock of another corporation, unlisted, 2,000 holders: not "more than 2,000".
`test unlisted stock of another corporation held by 2000` MEANS
    `test an item of consideration` `shares of stock of any other corporation, or depository receipts in respect thereof` TRUE FALSE 2000 FALSE
-- b.: unlisted, 2,001 holders.
`test unlisted stock of another corporation held by 2001` MEANS
    `test an item of consideration` `shares of stock of any other corporation, or depository receipts in respect thereof` TRUE FALSE 2001 FALSE
-- c.: cash in lieu of fractions of a. or b. shares.
`test cash in lieu of fractional shares` MEANS
    `test an item of consideration` `cash in lieu of fractional shares or fractional depository receipts` FALSE FALSE 0 TRUE
-- c.: cash in lieu of something else: not within c.
`test cash in lieu of fractions of other things` MEANS
    `test an item of consideration` `cash in lieu of fractional shares or fractional depository receipts` FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE
-- anything else: cash, property, rights.
`test cash for the stock` MEANS
    `test an item of consideration` `anything else` FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE

GIVEN p IS A `dg7 Provision under which a transaction is effected`
      listed IS A BOOLEAN
      holders IS A NUMBER
      items IS A LIST OF `s 262(b)(2) Item of consideration`
GIVETH A `s 262(b) Class or series in a transaction`
`test a class or series under` p listed holders items MEANS
    `s 262(b) Class or series in a transaction` WITH
        `the provision under which the transaction is effected` IS p
        `the shares are those of a converted or domesticated corporation` IS FALSE
        `the transaction is authorized pursuant to and in accordance with the provisions of s 265 or s 388` IS FALSE
        `the stock or the depository receipts in respect of it were listed on a national securities exchange` IS listed
        `the number of holders of record of the stock or the depository receipts` IS holders
        `the shares are those of the constituent corporation surviving the merger` IS FALSE
        `the merger did not require for its approval the vote of the stockholders of the surviving corporation as provided in s 251(f)` IS FALSE
        `what the holders are required to accept` IS items
        `the parent owns all of the stock of the subsidiary Delaware corporation immediately prior to the merger` IS TRUE

`test a 251 merger` MEANS `a merger or consolidation under s 251 other than a merger under s 251(g)`

§ `s 262(a) -- the words the subsection defines`

-- "any individual, corporation, partnership, unincorporated association or other entity": every kind of entity is a person.
#ASSERT `s 262(a) a person` `a natural person`
#ASSERT `s 262(a) a person` (`a corporation` `a stock corporation`)
#ASSERT `s 262(a) a person` (`a corporation` `a charitable nonstock corporation`)
#ASSERT `s 262(a) a person` `a general partnership`
#ASSERT `s 262(a) a person` `a limited liability limited partnership`
#ASSERT `s 262(a) a person` `a joint-stock association`
#ASSERT `s 262(a) a person` `a limited liability company`
#ASSERT `s 262(a) a person` `a common-law trust`

-- "a holder of record of stock in a corporation": both limbs.
#ASSERT `s 262(a) a stockholder` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(a) a stockholder` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(a) a stockholder` TRUE FALSE)

-- "what is ordinarily meant by those words".
#ASSERT `s 262(a) stock or a share` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(a) stock or a share` FALSE)

-- depository receipt: a receipt issued by a depository, representing an interest in shares solely of stock of a corporation,
-- which stock is deposited with the depository.
#ASSERT `s 262(a) a depository receipt` (`test an instrument with` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(a) a depository receipt` (`test an instrument with` FALSE))

-- beneficial owner: owner of shares held in voting trust or by a nominee on the person's behalf.
#ASSERT `s 262(a) a beneficial owner` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 262(a) a beneficial owner` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `s 262(a) a beneficial owner` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(a) a beneficial owner` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(a) a beneficial owner` FALSE TRUE FALSE)

§ `s 262(a) -- who is entitled to an appraisal`

-- Everything right and the circumstances of (b) or (c) exist: entitled.
#ASSERT `s 262(a) the stockholder is entitled to an appraisal of the fair value of the shares` `test the claimant who did everything right` TRUE
-- The circumstances of (b) and (c) do not exist: not entitled.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(a) the stockholder is entitled to an appraisal of the fair value of the shares` `test the claimant who did everything right` FALSE)
-- Voted in favor: "has neither voted in favor".
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(a) the stockholder is entitled to an appraisal of the fair value of the shares` (`test a claimant with` `this State` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE) TRUE)
-- Consented in writing under s 228.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(a) the stockholder is entitled to an appraisal of the fair value of the shares` (`test a claimant with` `this State` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE) TRUE)
-- Did not hold on the date of the demand.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(a) the stockholder is entitled to an appraisal of the fair value of the shares` (`test a claimant with` `this State` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE) TRUE)
-- Did not hold continuously through the effective date.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(a) the stockholder is entitled to an appraisal of the fair value of the shares` (`test a claimant with` `this State` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) TRUE)
-- Did not otherwise comply with subsection (d).
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(a) the stockholder is entitled to an appraisal of the fair value of the shares` (`test a claimant with` `this State` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) TRUE)
-- Not a holder of record (a beneficial owner is not a "stockholder" under (a); (d)(3) lets the beneficial owner demand).
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(a) the stockholder is entitled to an appraisal of the fair value of the shares` (`test a claimant with` `this State` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE) TRUE)
-- The stock is of a corporation formed elsewhere: "a corporation of this State".
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(a) the stockholder is entitled to an appraisal of the fair value of the shares` (`test a claimant with` `another jurisdiction of the United States` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE) TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(a) the stockholder is entitled to an appraisal of the fair value of the shares` (`test a claimant with` `a foreign jurisdiction outside the United States` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE) TRUE)

-- The first-sentence rule without the holder-of-record limb, which (d)(3) borrows for a beneficial owner.
#ASSERT `s 262(a) the claimant meets the conditions of the first sentence other than holding of record` (`test a claimant with` `this State` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(a) the claimant meets the conditions of the first sentence other than holding of record` (`test a claimant with` `this State` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))

§ `s 262(b) -- the time at which paragraph (b)(1) looks at the class or series`

#ASSERT `s 262(b)(1) the time at which the class or series is tested` `approved at a meeting of stockholders` EQUALS JUST `the record date fixed to determine the stockholders entitled to receive notice of the meeting`
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(1) the time at which the class or series is tested` `approved by consent of stockholders pursuant to s 228` EQUALS JUST `the record date fixed to determine the stockholders entitled to consent pursuant to s 228`
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(1) the time at which the class or series is tested` `approved pursuant to s 251(h)` EQUALS JUST `immediately prior to the execution of the agreement of merger under s 251(h)`
-- Not covered: the text names no time for a merger approved under s 253 or s 267.
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(1) the time at which the class or series is tested` `approved pursuant to s 253` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(1) the time at which the class or series is tested` `approved pursuant to s 267` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 262(b) -- the list of transactions`

-- The list: s 251 (other than s 251(g)), 252, 254, 255, 256, 257, 258, 263, 264, 266, 390.
#ASSERT `s 262(b) the provision is one of those the subsection lists` `a merger or consolidation under s 251 other than a merger under s 251(g)`
#ASSERT `s 262(b) the provision is one of those the subsection lists` `a merger or consolidation under s 252`
#ASSERT `s 262(b) the provision is one of those the subsection lists` `a merger or consolidation under s 254`
#ASSERT `s 262(b) the provision is one of those the subsection lists` `a merger or consolidation under s 255`
#ASSERT `s 262(b) the provision is one of those the subsection lists` `a merger or consolidation under s 256`
#ASSERT `s 262(b) the provision is one of those the subsection lists` `a merger or consolidation under s 257`
#ASSERT `s 262(b) the provision is one of those the subsection lists` `a merger or consolidation under s 258`
#ASSERT `s 262(b) the provision is one of those the subsection lists` `a merger or consolidation under s 263`
#ASSERT `s 262(b) the provision is one of those the subsection lists` `a merger or consolidation under s 264`
#ASSERT `s 262(b) the provision is one of those the subsection lists` `a conversion under s 266`
#ASSERT `s 262(b) the provision is one of those the subsection lists` `a transfer, domestication or continuance under s 390`
-- Not on the list: a s 251(g) merger, a s 253 merger, a s 267 merger, anything else.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b) the provision is one of those the subsection lists` `a merger under s 251(g)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b) the provision is one of those the subsection lists` `a merger of a parent corporation and its subsidiary under s 253`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b) the provision is one of those the subsection lists` `a merger of a parent entity and its subsidiary under s 267`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b) the provision is one of those the subsection lists` `a transaction effected under none of the provisions that s 261 and s 262 name`)

-- The bracketed exception: both facts needed.
#ASSERT `s 262(b) the transaction is excepted as one under s 265 or s 388 of a converted or domesticated corporation` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b) the transaction is excepted as one under s 265 or s 388 of a converted or domesticated corporation` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b) the transaction is excepted as one under s 265 or s 388 of a converted or domesticated corporation` FALSE TRUE)

§ `s 262(b)(1) -- the market-out and the s 251(f) proviso`

-- "listed on a national securities exchange or held of record by more than 2,000 holders": 2,000 is not "more than 2,000".
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(1) the class or series was listed or held of record by more than 2,000 holders` TRUE 10
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(1) the class or series was listed or held of record by more than 2,000 holders` FALSE 2001
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b)(1) the class or series was listed or held of record by more than 2,000 holders` FALSE 2000)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b)(1) the class or series was listed or held of record by more than 2,000 holders` FALSE 0)

-- The second proviso needs both: the surviving constituent corporation, and no vote required by s 251(f).
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(1) the shares are those of a surviving corporation whose stockholders did not vote under s 251(f)` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b)(1) the shares are those of a surviving corporation whose stockholders did not vote under s 251(f)` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b)(1) the shares are those of a surviving corporation whose stockholders did not vote under s 251(f)` FALSE TRUE)

§ `s 262(b)(2) -- what the holders are required to accept`

#ASSERT `s 262(b)(2)a. the item is stock of the surviving, resulting, converted or resulting entity, or depository receipts for it` `test survivor stock`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b)(2)a. the item is stock of the surviving, resulting, converted or resulting entity, or depository receipts for it` `test stock of a converted entity that is not a corporation`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b)(2)a. the item is stock of the surviving, resulting, converted or resulting entity, or depository receipts for it` `test listed stock of another corporation`)
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(2)b. the item is stock of any other corporation, or depository receipts for it, that is listed or widely held at the effective date` `test listed stock of another corporation`
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(2)b. the item is stock of any other corporation, or depository receipts for it, that is listed or widely held at the effective date` `test unlisted stock of another corporation held by 2001`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b)(2)b. the item is stock of any other corporation, or depository receipts for it, that is listed or widely held at the effective date` `test unlisted stock of another corporation held by 2000`)
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(2)c. the item is cash in lieu of fractional shares or fractional depository receipts of the kind in a. or b.` `test cash in lieu of fractional shares`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b)(2)c. the item is cash in lieu of fractional shares or fractional depository receipts of the kind in a. or b.` `test cash in lieu of fractions of other things`)
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(2) the item is described in a., b. or c.` `test survivor stock`
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(2) the item is described in a., b. or c.` `test cash in lieu of fractional shares`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b)(2) the item is described in a., b. or c.` `test cash for the stock`)

-- d.: a combination of a., b. and c. items.
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(2)d. the items are a combination of what a., b. and c. describe` (LIST `test survivor stock`, `test listed stock of another corporation`, `test cash in lieu of fractional shares`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b)(2)d. the items are a combination of what a., b. and c. describe` (LIST `test survivor stock`, `test cash for the stock`))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b)(2)d. the items are a combination of what a., b. and c. describe` EMPTY)

-- Appraisal rights are restored if the holders must accept "anything except" a. to d.
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(2) the holders are required to accept something other than what a. to d. describe` (LIST `test survivor stock`, `test cash for the stock`)
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(2) the holders are required to accept something other than what a. to d. describe` (LIST `test cash for the stock`)
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(2) the holders are required to accept something other than what a. to d. describe` (LIST `test unlisted stock of another corporation held by 2000`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b)(2) the holders are required to accept something other than what a. to d. describe` (LIST `test survivor stock`, `test cash in lieu of fractional shares`))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b)(2) the holders are required to accept something other than what a. to d. describe` (LIST `test survivor stock`))

§ `s 262(b)(3) -- the subsidiary of a s 253 or s 267 merger`

-- "all of the stock ... is not owned by the parent": the parent owns less than all.
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(3) appraisal rights are available for the shares of the subsidiary Delaware corporation` `a merger of a parent corporation and its subsidiary under s 253` FALSE
#ASSERT `s 262(b)(3) appraisal rights are available for the shares of the subsidiary Delaware corporation` `a merger of a parent entity and its subsidiary under s 267` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b)(3) appraisal rights are available for the shares of the subsidiary Delaware corporation` `a merger of a parent corporation and its subsidiary under s 253` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b)(3) appraisal rights are available for the shares of the subsidiary Delaware corporation` `a merger of a parent entity and its subsidiary under s 267` TRUE)
-- Only a s 253 or s 267 merger.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b)(3) appraisal rights are available for the shares of the subsidiary Delaware corporation` `a merger or consolidation under s 251 other than a merger under s 251(g)` FALSE)

§ `s 262(b) -- subsection (b) as a whole`

-- A s 251 merger, a class that is neither listed nor held by more than 2,000 holders, paid in cash: available.
#ASSERT `s 262(b) appraisal rights are available for the class or series` (`test a class or series under` `test a 251 merger` FALSE 50 (LIST `test cash for the stock`))
-- A listed class paid only in survivor stock: the market-out takes appraisal rights away.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b) appraisal rights are available for the class or series` (`test a class or series under` `test a 251 merger` TRUE 5000 (LIST `test survivor stock`)))
-- A listed class paid in cash: (b)(2) restores appraisal rights.
#ASSERT `s 262(b) appraisal rights are available for the class or series` (`test a class or series under` `test a 251 merger` TRUE 5000 (LIST `test cash for the stock`))
-- 2,000 holders is not "more than 2,000": the class is not caught by the market-out, so appraisal rights stay available even on stock for stock.
#ASSERT `s 262(b) appraisal rights are available for the class or series` (`test a class or series under` `test a 251 merger` FALSE 2000 (LIST `test survivor stock`))
-- 2,001 holders: the market-out applies, and the consideration is within a., so no appraisal rights.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b) appraisal rights are available for the class or series` (`test a class or series under` `test a 251 merger` FALSE 2001 (LIST `test survivor stock`)))
-- A s 251(g) merger is not on the list.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b) appraisal rights are available for the class or series` (`test a class or series under` `a merger under s 251(g)` FALSE 50 (LIST `test cash for the stock`)))
-- A s 253 merger where the parent owns all of the subsidiary's stock: not on the list, and (b)(3) does not apply.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b) appraisal rights are available for the class or series` (`test a class or series under` `a merger of a parent corporation and its subsidiary under s 253` FALSE 50 (LIST `test cash for the stock`)))
-- The same fixture reads parent owns all = TRUE; here the subsidiary is not wholly owned, built by hand.
#ASSERT `s 262(b) appraisal rights are available for the class or series` (`s 262(b) Class or series in a transaction` WITH `the provision under which the transaction is effected` IS `a merger of a parent corporation and its subsidiary under s 253`, `the shares are those of a converted or domesticated corporation` IS FALSE, `the transaction is authorized pursuant to and in accordance with the provisions of s 265 or s 388` IS FALSE, `the stock or the depository receipts in respect of it were listed on a national securities exchange` IS FALSE, `the number of holders of record of the stock or the depository receipts` IS 50, `the shares are those of the constituent corporation surviving the merger` IS FALSE, `the merger did not require for its approval the vote of the stockholders of the surviving corporation as provided in s 251(f)` IS FALSE, `what the holders are required to accept` IS EMPTY, `the parent owns all of the stock of the subsidiary Delaware corporation immediately prior to the merger` IS FALSE)
-- A s 255 merger and a s 390 transfer are on the list.
#ASSERT `s 262(b) appraisal rights are available for the class or series` (`test a class or series under` `a merger or consolidation under s 255` FALSE 50 (LIST `test cash for the stock`))
#ASSERT `s 262(b) appraisal rights are available for the class or series` (`test a class or series under` `a transfer, domestication or continuance under s 390` FALSE 50 (LIST `test cash for the stock`))
-- A transaction under none of the provisions: no.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b) appraisal rights are available for the class or series` (`test a class or series under` `a transaction effected under none of the provisions that s 261 and s 262 name` FALSE 50 (LIST `test cash for the stock`)))

-- The surviving corporation's shares in a merger that needed no vote of its stockholders under s 251(f) (second proviso of (b)(1)), taking only
-- cash: (b)(2), "notwithstanding paragraph (b)(1)", restores appraisal rights (fork F-b1); taking only its own stock: the proviso holds.
GIVEN items IS A LIST OF `s 262(b)(2) Item of consideration`
GIVETH A `s 262(b) Class or series in a transaction`
`test a surviving corporation's shares that needed no stockholder vote, paid with` items MEANS
    `s 262(b) Class or series in a transaction` WITH
        `the provision under which the transaction is effected` IS `a merger or consolidation under s 251 other than a merger under s 251(g)`
        `the shares are those of a converted or domesticated corporation` IS FALSE
        `the transaction is authorized pursuant to and in accordance with the provisions of s 265 or s 388` IS FALSE
        `the stock or the depository receipts in respect of it were listed on a national securities exchange` IS FALSE
        `the number of holders of record of the stock or the depository receipts` IS 50
        `the shares are those of the constituent corporation surviving the merger` IS TRUE
        `the merger did not require for its approval the vote of the stockholders of the surviving corporation as provided in s 251(f)` IS TRUE
        `what the holders are required to accept` IS items
        `the parent owns all of the stock of the subsidiary Delaware corporation immediately prior to the merger` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `s 262(b) appraisal rights are available for the class or series` (`test a surviving corporation's shares that needed no stockholder vote, paid with` (LIST `test cash for the stock`))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(b) appraisal rights are available for the class or series` (`test a surviving corporation's shares that needed no stockholder vote, paid with` (LIST `test survivor stock`)))

§ `s 262(c) -- what the certificate of incorporation provides`

#ASSERT `s 262(c) appraisal rights are available because the certificate of incorporation so provides` (LIST `an amendment to its certificate of incorporation`, `the sale of all or substantially all of the assets of the corporation`) `the sale of all or substantially all of the assets of the corporation`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(c) appraisal rights are available because the certificate of incorporation so provides` (LIST `an amendment to its certificate of incorporation`) `the sale of all or substantially all of the assets of the corporation`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(c) appraisal rights are available because the certificate of incorporation so provides` EMPTY `a conversion effected pursuant to s 266`)
#ASSERT `s 262(c) the provisions of this section apply as nearly as is practicable` (LIST `a conversion effected pursuant to s 266`) `a conversion effected pursuant to s 266`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262(c) the provisions of this section apply as nearly as is practicable` EMPTY `a conversion effected pursuant to s 266`)

§ `s 262 -- (b) and (c) together`

-- Not on the list and nothing in the certificate: no.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 262 appraisal rights are available for the shares` (`test a class or series under` `a merger under s 251(g)` FALSE 50 (LIST `test cash for the stock`)) EMPTY `any merger or consolidation in which the corporation is a constituent corporation`)
-- Not on the list, but the certificate gives appraisal rights on a merger: yes (subsection (c)).
#ASSERT `s 262 appraisal rights are available for the shares` (`test a class or series under` `a merger under s 251(g)` FALSE 50 (LIST `test cash for the stock`)) (LIST `any merger or consolidation in which the corporation is a constituent corporation`) `any merger or consolidation in which the corporation is a constituent corporation`
-- On the list and cash: yes by (b), whatever the certificate says.
#ASSERT `s 262 appraisal rights are available for the shares` (`test a class or series under` `test a 251 merger` FALSE 50 (LIST `test cash for the stock`)) EMPTY `any merger or consolidation in which the corporation is a constituent corporation`
